{"seq":4,"slug":"configmaps-and-secrets","title":"ConfigMap 与 Secret","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/devops-containerization/kubernetes-essentials/configmaps-and-secrets","wordCount":948,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"configmap-与-secret\">ConfigMap 与 Secret</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Kubernetes 倡导<strong>配置与镜像分离</strong>：同一个镜像通过不同的配置运行在开发、测试和生产环境。承载配置的两类资源是：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>ConfigMap</strong>：存储非敏感键值数据，通过环境变量或挂载文件注入 Pod。</li>\n<li><strong>Secret</strong>：存储密码、令牌、TLS 证书等敏感数据，默认仅做 Base64 编码。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>注入方式影响更新行为：Volume 挂载的配置会自动同步，环境变量注入的配置需要重启 Pod。ConfigMap 与 Secret 还可标记为 <code>immutable</code>，通过版本化命名与滚动更新实现安全变更。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"配置管理原则\">配置管理原则</h2><p>Kubernetes 倡导将应用配置与容器镜像分离——同一个镜像应能通过不同的配置运行在开发、测试和生产环境中。ConfigMap 和 Secret 是实现这一目标的核心资源。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    IMG[容器镜像&lt;br/&gt;不变的应用代码] --&gt; POD[Pod]&#10;    CM[ConfigMap&lt;br/&gt;非敏感配置] --&gt; POD&#10;    SEC[Secret&lt;br/&gt;敏感数据] --&gt; POD&#10;    POD --&gt; DEV[开发环境]&#10;    POD --&gt; PROD[生产环境]\">graph LR\n    IMG[容器镜像&lt;br/&gt;不变的应用代码] --&gt; POD[Pod]\n    CM[ConfigMap&lt;br/&gt;非敏感配置] --&gt; POD\n    SEC[Secret&lt;br/&gt;敏感数据] --&gt; POD\n    POD --&gt; DEV[开发环境]\n    POD --&gt; PROD[生产环境]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>原则</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>配置与代码分离</td>\n<td>镜像不包含环境特定的配置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>环境无关镜像</td>\n<td>同一镜像通过不同配置适配不同环境</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>敏感数据加密</td>\n<td>密码、密钥等使用 Secret 并加密存储</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>配置版本化</td>\n<td>配置变更应可追溯和回滚</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"configmap\">ConfigMap</h2><p>ConfigMap 存储非敏感的键值配置数据，可以通过环境变量或挂载文件的方式注入到 Pod 中。</p>\n<h3 id=\"创建-configmap\">创建 ConfigMap</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: v1&#10;kind: ConfigMap&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: app-config&#10;data:&#10;  LOG_LEVEL: &#39;info&#39;&#10;  MAX_CONNECTIONS: &#39;100&#39;&#10;  DATABASE_HOST: &#39;postgres.default.svc.cluster.local&#39;&#10;  nginx.conf: |&#10;    server {&#10;        listen 80;&#10;        server_name localhost;&#10;        location / {&#10;            proxy_pass http://api:3000;&#10;        }&#10;    }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ConfigMap</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">app-config</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  LOG_LEVEL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'info'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  MAX_CONNECTIONS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'100'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  DATABASE_HOST</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'postgres.default.svc.cluster.local'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  nginx.conf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    server {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        listen 80;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        server_name localhost;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        location / {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            proxy_pass http://api:3000;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    }</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"kubectl create configmap app-config \\&#10;  --from-literal=LOG_LEVEL=info \\&#10;  --from-literal=MAX_CONNECTIONS=100&#10;&#10;kubectl create configmap nginx-config \\&#10;  --from-file=nginx.conf=./config/nginx.conf&#10;&#10;kubectl get configmap app-config -o yaml\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> create</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> configmap</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> app-config</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --from-literal=LOG_LEVEL=info</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --from-literal=MAX_CONNECTIONS=100</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> create</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> configmap</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> nginx-config</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --from-file=nginx.conf=./config/nginx.conf</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> get</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> configmap</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> app-config</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -o</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> yaml</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"使用-configmap\">使用 ConfigMap</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: apps/v1&#10;kind: Deployment&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: api&#10;spec:&#10;  template:&#10;    spec:&#10;      containers:&#10;        - name: api&#10;          image: myapi:1.0.0&#10;          envFrom:&#10;            - configMapRef:&#10;                name: app-config&#10;          env:&#10;            - name: SPECIFIC_KEY&#10;              valueFrom:&#10;                configMapKeyRef:&#10;                  name: app-config&#10;                  key: LOG_LEVEL&#10;          volumeMounts:&#10;            - name: config-volume&#10;              mountPath: /etc/nginx/conf.d&#10;              readOnly: true&#10;      volumes:&#10;        - name: config-volume&#10;          configMap:&#10;            name: app-config&#10;            items:&#10;              - key: nginx.conf&#10;                path: default.conf\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">apps/v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Deployment</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">api</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  template</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      containers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">api</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          image</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">myapi:1.0.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          envFrom</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">configMapRef</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">app-config</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          env</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SPECIFIC_KEY</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              valueFrom</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                configMapKeyRef</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">app-config</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                  key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">LOG_LEVEL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          volumeMounts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">config-volume</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              mountPath</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/etc/nginx/conf.d</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              readOnly</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      volumes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">config-volume</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          configMap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">app-config</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            items</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">              - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">nginx.conf</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">default.conf</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>注入方式</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>实时更新</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>envFrom</td>\n<td>注入所有键值为环境变量</td>\n<td>需重启 Pod</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>env.valueFrom</td>\n<td>注入特定键为环境变量</td>\n<td>需重启 Pod</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>volumeMount</td>\n<td>以文件形式挂载</td>\n<td>自动更新</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 通过 Volume 挂载的 ConfigMap 在更新后会自动同步到 Pod 中（延迟约 1-2 分钟）。但以环境变量方式注入的值不会自动更新，需要重启 Pod 才能生效。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"secret\">Secret</h2><p>Secret 用于存储敏感数据，如密码、OAuth 令牌、TLS 证书等。Secret 的值以 Base64 编码存储。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: v1&#10;kind: Secret&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: db-credentials&#10;type: Opaque&#10;data:&#10;  username: YWRtaW4=&#10;  password: c3VwZXJzZWNyZXQ=\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Secret</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">db-credentials</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Opaque</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  username</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">YWRtaW4=</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  password</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">c3VwZXJzZWNyZXQ=</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"kubectl create secret generic db-credentials \\&#10;  --from-literal=username=admin \\&#10;  --from-literal=password=supersecret&#10;&#10;kubectl create secret tls app-tls \\&#10;  --cert=./tls.crt \\&#10;  --key=./tls.key&#10;&#10;echo -n &#39;admin&#39; | base64&#10;echo &#39;YWRtaW4=&#39; | base64 -d\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> create</span><span style=\"color:#032